# The C# binding generator (uniffi-bindgen-cs) that generate-csharp-binding.sh
# builds and runs. It is a separate tool from the UniFFI the workspace links,
# and each of its releases reads libraries from exactly one UniFFI minor, so
# csharp-binding.py pin-check fails when `uniffi_rs` differs from Cargo.lock.
#
# The last upstream release (0.11.1+v0.31.0) reads UniFFI 0.31 only and cannot
# open a library built with the workspace's 0.32. This pin is the open upstream
# pull request that ports the generator to 0.32 (NordSecurity/uniffi-bindgen-cs,
# "Upgrade to uniffi-rs 0.32.0"), pinned by commit because it is not merged or
# released. Move it to the upstream release tag as soon as one targets the
# workspace's UniFFI minor.
#
# This is external code: it is built and run only in the unprivileged
# `engine-build` job of the release workflow (no environment, no secrets), never
# in the protected signing job. check-release-gates.py fails if any other job
# references a binding generator.
repository=https://github.com/dennisameling/uniffi-bindgen-cs
rev=cf0aa7a8fb59358a846708730a58a02bf206ac05
version=0.12.0+v0.32.0
uniffi_rs=0.32
